    {
      "topic": "Rules of Signs in Integer Operations",
      "content": "- **Multiplication & Division**: $(-) \\times (-) = (+)$, $(+) \\times (-) = (-)$.\n- Product of an **odd number** of negative integers is negative; of an **even number** is positive."
    },
    {
      "topic": "Distributive Property",
      "content": "$a \\times (b + c) = (a \\times b) + (a \\times c)$. Example: $725 \\times 102 = 725 \\times (100 + 2) = 72,500 + 1,450 = 73,950$."
    },
    {
      "topic": "Properties of Integers",
      "content": "Integers are closed under addition, subtraction, and multiplication. Division by zero is undefined."
    }
  ],
